Description: Implements the Grassia(II)-Geometric (G2G) distribution model for
    discrete-time survival analysis. Provides maximum likelihood estimation for
    hazard models with a primary focus on time-varying covariates using
    person-period formatted data, while also supporting static (time-invariant)
    covariates formatted as standard single-record survival data.
